<title>USA: Continental Airlines stake raised by FMR.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines stake raised by FMR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including the Boston-based FMR Corp said Wednesday it has increased its stake in Continental Airlines Inc's outstanding Class B common shares to the equivalent of 4,629,206 shares or a 9.33 percent stake from 3,751,748 shares or a 7.85 percent stake.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought shares in the airline between Feb. 19 and April 16 at prices ranging from $28.63 to $33.50 each.</p>
